    "This works while both are on this Wi-Fi. To reach this Mac from anywhere, add its VPN or mesh hostname — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — under Mac ▸ Custom Address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das funktioniert, solange beide in diesem Wi-Fi sind. Um diesen Mac von überall zu erreichen, füge seinen VPN- oder Mesh-Hostnamen — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — unter Mac ▸ Eigene Adresse hinzu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This works while both are on this Wi-Fi. To reach this Mac from anywhere, add its VPN or mesh hostname — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — under Mac ▸ Custom Address."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esto funciona mientras ambos estén en esta red Wi-Fi. Para acceder a este Mac desde cualquier lugar, añade su nombre de host de VPN o malla —Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard— en Mac ▸ Dirección personalizada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela fonctionne tant que les deux sont sur ce réseau Wi-Fi. Pour joindre ce Mac depuis n'importe où, ajoutez son nom d'hôte VPN ou mesh — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — dans Mac ▸ Adresse personnalisée."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "यह तब काम करता है जब दोनों इसी Wi-Fi पर हों। कहीं से भी इस Mac तक पहुँचने के लिए इसका VPN या मेश होस्टनेम — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — Mac ▸ कस्टम पता में जोड़ें।"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "両方が同じWi-Fiにある間だけ使えます。どこからでもこのMacに接続するには、VPNまたはメッシュのホスト名（Tailscale、Tailnet、WireGuard）を「Mac ▸ カスタムアドレス」に追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso funciona enquanto os dois estiverem nesta rede Wi-Fi. Para acessar este Mac de qualquer lugar, adicione o nome de host da VPN ou da malha — Tailscale, Tailnet, WireGuard — em Mac ▸ Endereço personalizado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "只要两者都在此 Wi-Fi 网络上即可使用。若要从任何地方连接这台 Mac，请在“Mac ▸ 自定地址”中添加其 VPN 或网格主机名（Tailscale、Tailnet、WireGuard）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
